    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n114929" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρῡσό-παστος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
		also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			Alc.
			<u>Fr.</u>
			90
		</span></i> Lobel: (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάσσω</span>):—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>shot with gold,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κυνία</span> l. c.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χ. τιήρης</span> a turban <i>of gold tissue,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				8.120
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ χ. ἕσθλα</span> (Wilamowitz
			for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐσθλά</span>) <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				776
			</span></i> (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χ. κόσμος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					50.34
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταῖς ξυστίσιν ταῖς χ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Eub.
					134
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μίτρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Duris
					14J.
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐσθής</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Ind.</u>
					8
				</span></i>
			; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρυσήλατος,</span> Iamb.post
				Polem.<i><span class="en">
				p.50
			</span></i> Hinck.</div>
